        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "It is recognized by the Employer and the Union that it is every Employee's responsibility to perform the duties of their position in a manner which creates a cooperative environment and to work as a team in performing their duties. Further the parties recognize that the objective of all employees is to meet the needs of the Employer's customers.",
            "block_bbox": [
                336,
                120,
                1474,
                236
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    336.0,
                    120.0
                ],
                [
                    1474.0,
                    120.0
                ],
                [
                    1474.0,
                    236.0
                ],
                [
                    336.0,
                    236.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "A. It is recognized by the Employer and the Union that a sales employee's primary duty is to serve and attend to the needs of the Employer's customers. It is recognized that selling employees may be required to work in non-selling activities, and at times in non-sell areas in order to properly assist or provide for customer needs, with the following limitations:",
            "block_bbox": [
                337,
                260,
                1447,
                377
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    337.0,
                    260.0
                ],
                [
                    1447.0,
                    260.0
                ],
                [
                    1447.0,
                    377.0
                ],
                [
                    337.0,
                    377.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. This work will be distributed as equitably as possible among all the sales employees in a given department, and shall not be assigned in a manner which prevents the salesperson from attending to customers who are in the department. Nor shall such non-sell work be assigned in a manner which purposely curtails a salesperson's opportunity to attend to their own clientele. Finally, the assignments shall not be of a length or duration that unreasonably restricts the salesperson from their primary duty. Sales Associates will be scheduled no more than half (½) an hour before store opening or after store closing. Sales Associates may work in addition to the half (½) hour on a voluntary basis.",
            "block_bbox": [
                338,
                401,
                1461,
                603
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    338.0,
                    401.0
                ],
                [
                    1461.0,
                    401.0
                ],
                [
                    1461.0,
                    603.0
                ],
                [
                    338.0,
                    603.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. A salesperson may volunteer to work with management approval prior to or in addition to the half-hour ( $ \\frac{1}{2} $) limit set in Section 18, A. 1, and shall be given non-productive hours.",
            "block_bbox": [
                338,
                625,
                1441,
                687
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    338.0,
                    625.0
                ],
                [
                    1441.0,
                    625.0
                ],
                [
                    1441.0,
                    687.0
                ],
                [
                    338.0,
                    687.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. The following guidelines will be used in determining appropriate non-sell duties to be performed by sales associates:",
            "block_bbox": [
                339,
                710,
                1448,
                770
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    339.0,
                    710.0
                ],
                [
                    1448.0,
